// src/main_faults.ci: K3. The probes of src/probes.ci, one per entry. The kernel runs this
// main in a loop (rt/ctx.c): entry i gets the text of i as its argument, a fault is printed as
// a canonical record and the loop goes on; the hosted twin runs the same program once per i.

import src.probes;

void main(in U8[_] args) {
    probes.run(args);
}
